---
// AboutReef — Sunlight Zone (200-500m)
---

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__header reveal-up">
      <h6 class="text-label">▼ 200M — SUNLIGHT ZONE</h6>
      <h2>A studio where design<br/>and engineering converge</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__philosophy reveal-left">
        <p class="text-large">
          We craft digital experiences that go beyond the surface.
          Every pixel is engineered, every interaction is intentional,
          every project is a deep dive into what's possible.
        </p>
        <p>
          VennStack Studio exists at the intersection of design and technology —
          where creative vision meets technical precision. We don't hand off designs
          to developers. We build end-to-end, because the best work happens
          when craft and code are inseparable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about__values reveal-stagger">
        <div class="about__value-card glass-card reveal-stagger-item">
          <div class="about__value-icon bio-pulse">◆</div>
          <h4>Immersive Craft</h4>
          <p class="text-small">Every project is an experience. We build interfaces that pull people in and reward exploration.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__value-card glass-card reveal-stagger-item">
          <div class="about__value-icon bio-pulse" style="animation-delay: -1s;">◆</div>
          <h4>Engineering-First</h4>
          <p class="text-small">Design and code are two sides of one discipline. No handoffs, no compromises, no shortcuts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__value-card glass-card reveal-stagger-item">
          <div class="about__value-icon bio-pulse" style="animation-delay: -2s;">◆</div>
          <h4>Depth Over Volume</h4>
          <p class="text-small">We take fewer projects and go deeper. Quality isn't negotiable — it's the starting point.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="about__stats reveal-stagger">
      <div class="about__stat reveal-stagger-item">
        <span class="about__stat-number bio-glow-text">50+</span>
        <span class="about__stat-label text-label">Projects</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about__stat reveal-stagger-item">
        <span class="about__stat-number bio-glow-text">4+</span>
        <span class="about__stat-label text-label">Years</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about__stat reveal-stagger-item">
        <span class="about__stat-number bio-glow-text">30+</span>
        <span class="about__stat-label text-label">Clients</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about__stat reveal-stagger-item">
        <span class="about__stat-number bio-glow-text">∞</span>
        <span class="about__stat-label text-label">Curiosity</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: var(--section-padding) 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .about__header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .about__header h6 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about__header h2 {
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .about__philosophy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about__values {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about__value-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    transition: transform var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base);
  }

  .about__value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--glow-md);
  }

  .about__value-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.2);
  }

  .about__value-card h4 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about__value-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .about__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .about__stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about__stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 200;
  }

  .about__stat-label {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .about__stats {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
